{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56687","headline":"贽高骈歌（题拟） · 无名氏","name":"贽高骈歌（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五色真龙上汉时，愿把霓旌引烟策。\n（见《南部新书》卷癸。\n）（〖1〗《南部新书》：「高骈在淮南，有贽歌者，末章云〖略〗。\n公说，乃辟爲从事。\n及公遇害，有识者多嗤其言过也。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56687.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56687","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}